      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is why you dont use 4K textures x # of materials. Vram would be a nice performance metric to add because currently you can have medium to good avatars with very high vram usage x40 people and theres a limit to everyones amount of vram, ms gets bogged very hard past 95% gpu usage. The last 3% being that noticable ms delay, low frames and bad frametimes. I'm sure accounting for this metric will make many people unhappy with their rating, as they optimized with the current template in mind and not for realtime performance.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
