      "value": "@{5a9fe9983955314156acc4f7|full_name}: Actually, DXT Compressed textures stay compressed in GPU Memory. Crunch compression doesn't, Crunch has to decompress upon load and is actually bad for performance when loading in avatars. But regular DXT5 or DXT1 compression is great for both your AssetBundle and VRAM",
      "viewerReactions": null,
