      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would like to add: Thry's calculator also includes meshes, which the in-game texture memory metric does not account for. There is an avatar I'm helping someone with where I got the main textures below 50 MB, but Thry's said it is 170 MB due to the complex meshes with lots of blend shapes.",
